# ✅ Windows Setup Checklist

**Use this to verify everything is working before starting the application.**

---

## Pre-Installation Checklist

- [ ] Windows 10 or 11 (64-bit recommended)
- [ ] At least 4GB RAM available
- [ ] At least 2GB disk space
- [ ] Internet connection for downloading software
- [ ] Administrator access to install software

---

## Installation Checklist

### Python Installation
- [ ] Downloaded Python 3.10+ from https://www.python.org/downloads/
- [ ] Installed Python (remember to check "Add Python to PATH")
- [ ] Opened PowerShell and verified:  `python --version`
- [ ] Verified pip works: `pip --version`

### Node.js Installation
- [ ] Downloaded Node.js v16+ from https://nodejs.org/
- [ ] Installed Node.js
- [ ] Opened PowerShell and verified: `node --version`
- [ ] Verified npm works: `npm --version`

### PostgreSQL Installation
- [ ] Downloaded PostgreSQL from https://www.postgresql.org/download/windows/
- [ ] Installed PostgreSQL (remember the postgres password!)
- [ ] Noted down:  postgres password:  `_____________`
- [ ] Opened PowerShell and verified: `psql --version`
- [ ] PostgreSQL service is running

### Git Installation
- [ ] Downloaded Git from https://git-scm.com/download/win
- [ ] Installed Git
- [ ] Opened PowerShell and verified: `git --version`

---

## Database Setup Checklist

- [ ] Created database named:  `visitor_control`
- [ ] Created user named: `visitor_user`
- [ ] Set user password to: `visitor_pass`
