## Backend Setup Checklist

- [ ] Navigated to `backend/` folder
- [ ] Created virtual environment:  `python -m venv venv`
- [ ] Activated venv: `venv\Scripts\activate` (see `(venv)` in prompt)
- [ ] Upgraded pip: `python -m pip install --upgrade pip`
- [ ] Installed dependencies: `pip install -r requirements.txt`
- [ ] Copied `.env.example` to `.env`
- [ ] Edited `.env` with correct values:
  - [ ] `DATABASE_URL=postgresql://visitor_user:visitor_pass@localhost:5432/visitor_control`
  - [ ] `SECRET_KEY=<generated secure key>`
  - [ ] `DEBUG=False`
- [ ] Tested backend start: `python -m uvicorn app.main:app --reload`
  - [ ] Shows:  `Uvicorn running on http://0.0.0.0:8000`
  - [ ] Can visit: http://localhost:8000/docs (API Docs load)

